{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12191","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12191/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12191/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12191/events","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12191","id":1207155841,"node_id":"I_kwDOBlCVUc5H87yB","number":12191,"title":"[DocDB] Table partition boundaries structure mismatch for indexes","user":{"login":"arybochkin","id":79331145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MzMxMTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79331145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin","html_url":"https://github.com/arybochkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":711841622,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MTE4NDE2MjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":"This issue is a bug"},{"id":1290759928,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjkwNzU5OTI4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/area/docdb","name":"area/docdb","color":"0c4fcc","default":false,"description":"YugabyteDB core features"},{"id":1419822171,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIyMTcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/critical","name":"priority/critical","color":"ad1445","default":false,"description":"Critical issue"},{"id":4199362411,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBlCVUc76TS9r","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/2.14%20Backport%20Required","name":"2.14 Backport Required","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"arybochkin","id":79331145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MzMxMTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79331145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin","html_url":"https://github.com/arybochkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"arybochkin","id":79331145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MzMxMTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79331145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin","html_url":"https://github.com/arybochkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2022-04-18T15:22:10Z","updated_at":"2022-11-01T13:59:41Z","closed_at":"2022-11-01T13:59:40Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-1836](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-1836)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nIndex creation supports `split at` statement to explicitly specify partitions for tablets.\r\nThe syntax example:\r\n```\r\ncreate unique index idx1 on test1(name ASC) split at values(('p'));\r\n```\r\n\r\nTaking into account the index table schema has at least one internal hidden column (refer to [documentation](https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/blob/c2deaf4af152b08e009f945ca7d662d325d6c46a/src/yb/common/pg_system_attr.h#L38)), it is impossible to specify a value for that particular column inside split at instruction.\r\n\r\nLet's assume the following example\r\n```\r\n# create table test1(id int primary key, name text);\r\n# create unique index idx1 on test1(name ASC) split at values(('p'));\r\n```\r\nAs internal value cannot be specified, the partition bound looks like `DocKey([], [\"p\"])`, so the last column from the primary/doc key is completely ignored! The encoded value of the partition bound looks like `\"Sp\\x00\\x00!\" == 5370000021`. But the expected partition key should look like `\"Sp\\x00\\x00$!\" == 537000002421`, where '$' byte(s) stand for the value of internal index columns (possible values are `kNullLow`, `kNullHigh` or `base table ctid`).\r\n\r\nThe partition bound structure mismatch may lead to a case when last part of `YBOperation.partition_key` (equals to `0x00`) for the subsequent insert operation is compared against `kGroupEnd == 0x21` and the operation is forwarded to an incorrect tablet. Refer to #12190 for the details.\r\n\r\nOnce #12190 is fixed, there should be no visible side effects because of the `partition_key` structure mismatch for split at statement, but it is still a good point to fix the issue.\r\n\r\nFor any questions, contact @arybochkin ","closed_by":{"login":"arybochkin","id":79331145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MzMxMTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79331145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin","html_url":"https://github.com/arybochkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12191/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12191/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}